&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4.⁠ ⁠Voice of the Customer to Product&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Capture and synthesize client feedback, technical requirements, and feature requests to share with Xendit&#39;s product and engineering teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of competitor solutions and market trends regionally/globally - SEA payments corridor, providing insights to inform product roadmap decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to internal knowledge bases, playbooks, and enablement materials for the broader commercial team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5.⁠ ⁠Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Account Executives to develop account strategies and identify upsell/cross-sell opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Customer Success and Integration teams to ensure smooth handoffs and long-term client satisfaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global Solutions Engineering peers to share best practices and scalable solution patterns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do whatever it takes to make Xendit succeed!&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.xendit.co/en/&quot;&gt;Xendit&lt;/a&gt; provides payment infrastructure across Southeast Asia and is expanding to Greater China and LATAM. We process payments, power marketplaces, disburse payroll and loans, provide KYC solutions, prevent fraud, and help businesses grow exponentially. We serve our customers by providing a suite of world-class APIs, eCommerce platform integrations, and easy to use applications for individual entrepreneurs, SMEs, and enterprises alike.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our main focus is building the most advanced payment rails for Southeast Asia, with a clear goal in mind — to make payments across and within SEA simple, secure and easy for everyone. We serve thousands of businesses ranging from SMEs to multinational enterprises, and process millions of transactions monthly. We’ve been growing rapidly since our inception in 2015, onboarding hundreds of new customers every month, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2021/03/02/indonesia-payments-infra-startup-xendit-raises-64-6m/&quot;&gt;backed by global top-10 VCs&lt;/a&gt;. We’re proud to be featured on among the fastest growing companies by &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.ycombinator.com/topcompanies&quot;&gt;Y-Combinator&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role exists&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designing for developers is a distinct craft. The interface is often the dashboard, the API reference, the sandbox, the error states, and the logs, information-dense surfaces for a technical audience with little patience for friction. This role makes the developer&#39;s experience clear, fast, and trustworthy across those surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll own&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product design for the developer dashboard &lt;/strong&gt;and integration surfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information design for docs and API reference, &lt;/strong&gt;in partnership with Engineering and content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Error states, empty states, sandbox and testing flows, &lt;/strong&gt;the moments where developers get stuck.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Discovery with developers, &lt;/strong&gt;and close collaboration with the DevEx PM and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You report to the Product Design &amp;amp; UX Director for Customer Lifecycle and are embedded with the Developer Experience PM and Engineering as the design owner for developer-facing surfaces. You adopt and extend the domain design system rather than owning it, partnering with the senior design-system lead on shared patterns, so your time is weighted toward product work from the start. The domain works from validated findings rather than assumptions and values direct, candid critique.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product-design craft &lt;/strong&gt;with evidence of designing for technical, developer, or data-dense products. A portfolio is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfort with information-dense UI,&lt;/strong&gt; dashboards, tables, complex states.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The ability to partner closely with engineers. &lt;/strong&gt;You work well alongside technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A strong plus: having designed docs, API reference, or developer tools; technical literacy; fintech experience.&lt;/p&gt;
